+ * 1071: khaje's TLMM is tile based, exactly like bengal
+ * (pinctrl-khaje.c: NORTH 0x0, WEST 0x100000, SOUTH 0x500000, EAST 0x900000,
+ * REG_SIZE 0x1000, ctl_reg = tile + REG_SIZE*pin). Pins 0..3, 80 and 86 are
+ * WEST, pin 36 is EAST. The n*0x1000 and (n+1)*0x1000 probes of 1052..1070
+ * were therefore reading the NORTH tile, which khaje does not populate: such
